# 🤖 AI Customer Support Agent

An AI-powered customer support automation built with **n8n and AI** that receives customer inquiries, analyzes customer messages, and generates helpful responses automatically.

## 🎯 Project Overview

Customer support teams often spend valuable time answering repetitive questions and handling routine customer inquiries.

This automation demonstrates how AI can assist with customer support by analyzing incoming messages and generating relevant responses, helping businesses reduce repetitive manual work, improve response efficiency, and provide faster customer assistance.

## 🚨 The Problem

As a business grows, the volume of customer inquiries can increase significantly.

Without an automated support process:

* Support teams spend time answering repetitive questions
* Customer response times can increase
* Manual responses may become inconsistent
* Support teams have less time for complex customer issues
* Businesses may struggle to efficiently handle a growing number of inquiries

## 💡 The Solution

This n8n workflow uses an AI-powered agent to process customer inquiries and generate appropriate responses.

The automation:

1. Receives a customer message through a chat trigger.
2. Sends the message to the AI Agent.
3. Uses an AI language model to analyze the inquiry.
4. Generates a relevant and helpful response.
5. Returns the response to the customer.

## 🔧 Workflow

```text
Customer Message
       ↓
Chat Trigger
       ↓
AI Agent
       ↓
AI Language Model
       ↓
Generated Response
       ↓
Customer
```

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* **n8n** — Workflow automation platform
* **AI Agent** — Processes customer inquiries and generates responses
* **AI Language Model** — Analyzes messages and produces responses
* **Chat Trigger** — Receives incoming customer messages

